195 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 84 0 R/E(Tadcaster Albion are possibly the surprise team in the league this season and in the wrong way, having reached the play offs last season they were expected to be amongst the front runners this season and yet are currently second bottom of the league - they have actually won only 3 of 17 games played in the league with 2 of those coming in October versus Barton Town currently placed 3rd in the league and Albion Sports and they also took a point away at Bottesford Town, but defeats to Handsworth, Penistone Church and Retford FC are showing their inconsistencies. )/Pg 19 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

