198 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 84 0 R/E(It was FA Vase time last weekend with two of the four NCEL sides playing going through to the 3rd Round - Retford FC had an excellent 5-1 victory away at NWCFL Maghull and Bottesford Town won away on penalties at Chadderton also from the NWCFL - whilst the other sides Brigg Town and Parkgate were knocked out of the competition - Brigg Town unfortunately going out to Northern League side North Shields 4-3 on penalties after having led 2-0 at one stage North Shields fought back to draw 2-2 with the equalising goal coming in the 89th minute from the penalty spot, and then went on to win the game 4-3 on penalties  )/Pg 19 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

199 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 84 0 R/E(Parkgate, having been reinstated from the last round suffered a 4-1 away at Nelson, another side from the NWCFL. )/Pg 19 0 R/K[7]>>
