207 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 85 0 R/E(FA Trophy - Bridlington Town had an excellent win in the last round of the FA Trophy beating NPL Premier Division side Curzon Ashton, who had played in the National League North for a number of seasons before being relegated last season, their reward in the Second Round Proper is a home draw against National League North side Macclesfield Town.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

208 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 85 0 R/E(Another game that caught my eye in this competition was the Hebburn Town v Guiseley AFC tie as both sides drew each other in the FA Cup earlier in the season, with Guiseley beating their higher in the pyramid side 4-1 so no doubt Hebburn will be looking to put that right when they play each other again. )/Pg 20 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

209 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 85 0 R/E(FA Cup - The 1st Round proper of the FA Cup sees two Step 4 clubs still in the competition namely AFC Rushden & Diamonds and Stafford Rangers with both sides having started in the competition at Extra Preliminary Round stage, both had surprise wins in the last round with the Diamonds beating National League North side Morecambe 2-1 at home and Stafford Town going one better when beating National League side Gateshead FC 5-0 in a replay after having drawn 1-1 away.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

210 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 85 0 R/E(In the First Round proper both sides have drawn Football League sides with AFC Rushden & Diamonds drawing League 1 side Burton Albion away and Stafford Rangers drawing League 2 side Grimsby Town at home.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[4]>>
