<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 99 0 R/E(Pickering Town Community Football Club, hereafter known as the Club, is committed to ensuring the health, safety and the welfare of its Members, Playing Staff, Spectators and Visitors, so far as is reasonably practical. The club fully accepts its responsibilities under all subsequent health and safety legislation introduced for ensuring the health. safety and welfare of those affected by the club activities. It is the policy of the club to prevent accidental loss through personal injury, ill health and damage to property throughout and to continually promote a proactive health and safety)/Pg 34 0 R/K[0]>>
